# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-t8 four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-t8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the branch. The device pieces of serving_octo.DEVICE_PIECES are BUILT on the host and tested
# on CPU; none of them has run on a card, and the admission logs every card question as an '[OCTO] UNQUALIFIED' line (serving_octo.UNQUALIFIED_ITEMS, each naming the job that settles it).
# Substitute the placeholder in every template with one command (sed -i 's/tp4-octo-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every
# template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.

# A1 (AUDITED ATTACH, the first octo attach): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-audit, the same tests as A0. READ in this order and stop at the first failure:
# (1) the attach: '[OCTO] admitted mode=alternate rows=8 users=8 min_live=6 (gate only)' once, the UNQUALIFIED lines, no '[OCTO] refused'; the third block compiled ZERO programs after block A's trace capture (the program counts logged around each capture); DRAM after attach within
# 0.2 GB of A0's per chip (the pool gave back what the block took; an allocation failure at the third block's construction is the named memory risk, ORDER.txt); the readers: '[PINDIAG] extent replay engaged segments=8 flags=0x21,...,0x21 ... geometry=G8B1' and a '[QWEN-SDPA] runtime-extent entries=1 kv_share=false' factory line (octo_judge reads both); the GDN glue's known state at eight-row users, '[PINDIAG] tp4 vglue octo 8-row served path' (not a FALLBACK); (2) c2_smoke_check clean, whose octo rule judges the log (octo_judge.judge): at least 16 octo rounds at rows=8, at least 16 counted rounds of EACH shape alternating strictly, no program compiled on a switch,
# zero audit mismatch (T1, T2, extent) on either shape; (3) python scripts/ci/octo_compare.py --control <A0 smoke log> --octo <A1 smoke log> --octo-container <A1 container log> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-audit exits 0: every answer's content hash,
# reasoning hash, token count and finish reason equal, user by user. ANY difference is NO-GO. Stop rule.

C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent4_solo,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
